## 3. Detailed Component Architecture & Layout Mathematics

### 3.1. TV-Safe Margin Geometry (1920x1080)
The television screen operates at 1920x1080 resolution with a mandatory 5% overscan boundary:
- Horizontal safe margin: $96\text{px}$ on both left and right.
- Valid interactive horizontal bounds: $[96\text{px}, 1824\text{px}]$.
- Usable width: $1824 - 96 = 1728\text{px}$.

#### Search Bar Bounds
- Width: `max-width: 1100px`, centered with `margin: 0 auto`.
- Left coordinate: $(1920 - 1100) / 2 = 410\text{px}$.
